  "provenance": {
    "prompt": "Original Relic Tide Brine Stalker, an amphibious drowned armored creature, upright biped with grounded compact proportions, head one quarter of body height. Hand-authored-looking adventure pixel sprite matching the supplied explorer material: clean native pixel clusters, thin warm dark outline, limestone-blue cool shadows and warm amber highlights. Moss-teal amphibian skin, blunt ridged head, readable small amber eyes, battered ochre brass shoulder and chest armor, dark cloth waist wrap, broad separate webbed feet and two readable clawed hands. Strong original silhouette, no borrowed game character, no gore, no weapon or held prop. High top-down view, standing relaxed facing south toward the camera, full body including both feet. Consistent anatomy and material, detailed but readable at native resolution. Transparent background, no ground shadow, no effects or text.",
    "seed": 20261010,
