        "loop": true,
        "prompt": "Seamless quiet standing idle, facing the supplied direction. Feet planted, subtle chest breathing and tiny armor settling, relaxed lowered claws. Keep the same silhouette, anatomy and colors; no foot sliding or turning."
      },
      "attack": {
