        "prompt": "Brief one-shot claw strike, facing the supplied direction. Start in planted standing idle, wind back one claw, swipe once forward with a clear weight shift, then recover to the same standing idle. Feet stay in place; no victim, projectile, effects, gore, turning or costume changes."
      },
      "stun": {
        "frames": 4,
